<title>UK: EIB sets 15 billion peseta 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 15 billion peseta 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Caja Madrid.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    15 BLN PTA    COUPON     6.79	MATURITY    29.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    29.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	PRIVATE PLACEMENT</p>
<p>	     ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
